cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this prototype in academic work, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "SciDataMAS for DeepSeek Harness"
abstract: >-
  A DeepSeek Harness plugin that turns a session into a local-first scientific
  data lake: adaptive metadata schemas, DAG-augmented rich metadata,
  debate-based schema validation, staged human-in-the-loop ingestion,
  natural-language retrieval, Zenodo import, and a DSH-native Web panel.
authors:
